<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">1Teselonqe</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tese</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Teselonqe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosi Teselonqe Asaas Xaafida Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Teselonqe Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Koyro Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Teselonqey, Roome biittan de7iya Maqedooniya awurajjaas waanna katama. Phawuloosi Teselonqen woosa keethaa Filphisiyuusa yeddidi bidaappe guye essis. Gidoshin, Ayhudeta ammanuwa ekkanaw giigettidi uttida Ayhude gidonna asay, Phawuloosi tamaarssiya, kiristtinna ammano timirttiyan xoonettida gisho, Ayhudeti qanaattidi, Phawuloosa timirttiya phalqqidosona. Hessa gisho, Phawuloosi gam77onnashin Teselonqe yeddidi, Beeriya bis (1:9-10). Guyeppe I Teselonqe gakkida wode iya maaddiya Ximotiyoosi Teselonqe woosa keethan de7iya hanotaa iyaw geeshshidi odis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi koyro kiitaa Teselonqe asaas xaafiday, ammaniyaa asaa zoranaassanne minthethanaassa. I entta ammanuwanne entta siiquwa lo77o markkatethaa si7ida wode Xoossaa galatees. Kase I entta giddon de7ida wode ay mela duussu de7idaakko entta hassaysees. Hessafe Kiristtoosa nam77antho yuussabaa oyshettida oyshaas zaaro immees. He oyshatappe guuthati, “Kiristtoosi nam77antho yaanappe sinthe hayqqida ammaniyaa asi Kiristtoosa yuussay immiya merinaa de7o ekkanaw dandda7ii? Kiristtoosi nam77antho yaanay awudee?” yaageyssa. Phawuloosi he injje wodiya go7ettidi, “Kiristtoosa nam77antho yuussaa ufayssan naagishe I yaana gakkanaw woppu gidi hintte ooso oothite” yaagidi zorees.</para>
  <para style="iot">1Teselonqe kiitaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa ufayssanne galata 1:2-3:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniya asaa de7o kaalesuwa 4:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa nam77antho yuussabaa 4:13-5:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetha zore 5:12-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa 5:23-28</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Phawuloosi Sillaaseynne Ximotiyoosi Teselonqe woosa keethan de7iya, Xoossaa Aawabaanne Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosabaa gidida asaas xaafida kiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Ha@O 17:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Aadho keehatethaynne saroy hinttew gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Teselonqe asaa de7uwanne ammanuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nuuni Xoossaa woossiya wode ubban hinttena qoppishe hintte gisho ubba wode Xoossaa galatoos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossaa nu Aawa sinthan ammanon hintte oothida oosuwa, siiqon hintte daaburida daaburanne Yesuus Kiristtoosan de7iya ufayssaa ekkanaw hintte minnidi eqqida equwa ubba wode nuuni qoppoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu ishato, Xoossay hinttena doseyssanne ba ase oothidi hinttena dooridayssa nuuni eroos. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ays giikko, nuuni Wonggelaa doona xalaalan gidonnashin, wolqqan, Geeshsha Ayyaananinne Wonggelaa tumaa ammanon hinttew ehida. Nuuni hinttera gam77ida wode ubban hintte gisho waanidi de7idaakko hintte ereeta. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hintte daro meto ekkikokka Geeshsha Ayyaanay immiya ufayssan kiitaa ekkideta; nunanne Godaa daanideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Ha@O 17:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Maqedooniyanne Akkaya biittan de7iya ammaniyaa ubbaas leemiso gidideta. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Godaa qaalay hinttefe keyidi, Maqedooniyaninne Akkaya xalaalan gidonnashin, Xoossaa hintte ammaneyssi ubbason si7ettis. Hiza, nuuni gaanabay aykkoka baawa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nuuni hintteko bida wode hintte nuna mokkida mokuwanne hinttee, hintte eeqa aggidi tumaanne de7o Xoossaa haggaazanaw hintte simmidayssa entti bantta huu7en odoosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qassi Xoossaa Na7ay, Yesuusi, Xoossay hayqoppe denthidayssi, sinthafe yaana Xoossaa hanquwafe nuna ashshanayssi, saloppe yaanayssa hintte naageyssa entti markkattosona.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Teselonqen oothida oosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, nuuni hintteko biday mela gidonnayssa hinttee, hintte huu7en ereeta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin nuuni hintteko Teselonqe yaanappe sinthe Filphisiyuusa kataman waayettidayssanne cayettidayssa hintte ereeta. Daro ixoy de7ikkoka hinttew iya Wonggelaa odana mela Xoossay nuus minotethi immis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Ha@O 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuuni hinttena zoriday baleson woykko cimon woykko genen gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin Xoossay nunan ammanettidi ba Wonggelaa odana mela nuus hadara immida gisho odoos. Nu hessa oothey nu wozanaa be7iya Xoossaa ufayssanaassafe attin ase ufayssanaassa gidenna. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu miishe yaaridi worddo hinttena sabbishe hintteko yoonnayssa loythidi ereeta; Xoossay nuus markka. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nuuni hinttefe gidin woykko hara asa oodefekka bonchcho koyibookko. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nuuni Kiristtoosa hawaare gideyssada nuus koshshiyabaa immite gidi ekkanaw dandda7os, shin aaya ba nayta dichcheyssa mela hintte giddon ashkke gidida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nu hinttena dosida gisho Xoossaa Wonggelaa hinttew shaako xalaala gidonnashin, nu de7uwakka hinttew immanaw giigida. Hintte nuus daro al77o. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu ishato, nu oosuwanne nu daabura ereeta. Hinttew Xoossaa Wonggelaa odishe, hinttena waaysonna mela qammanne gallas oothida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nu de7oy hintte ammaneyssata mataninne Xoossaa sinthan geeshshi, xillonne borettonnayssa gideyssas hintte markka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nuuni hinttew huu7en huu7en yelidayssati bantta naytas haneyssada hanidayssa ereeta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu hinttena zorida, minthethida. Qassi ba kawotethaanne ba bonchchuwa shaakkanaw hinttena xeegiya Xoossaa ufayssiya de7o hintte daana mela hinttew minthidi odida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hinttew nuuni Xoossaa qaalaa odida wode asa qaalada gidonnashin, Xoossaa qaalada si7idi ekkida gisho nuuni ubba wode Xoossaa galatoos. I tuma Xoossaa qaala; Xoossaa qaalay ammaniyaa hinttenan oothees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta ishato, hintte Yihuda biittan de7iya woosa keethatanne yan Kiristtoos Yesuusa kaalliya asatada hanideta. Entta Ayhudeti waaysidayssada hinttenakka hintte biittaa asay waaysidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Ha@O 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>He Ayhudeti Godaa Yesuusanne nabeta wodhdhidosona; qassi nuna goodidosona. Entti Xoossaa ufayssonayssatanne ase ubbaa ixxeyssata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Ha@O 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Entti hari attoshin, Ayhude gidonna asay attana mela nuuni enttaw qaalaa odeyssa diggoosona. Hessada hanidi entta nagaraa xuu7ay kumana gakkanaw ubba wode nagara oothoosona. Wurssethan, Xoossaa hanqoy entta bolla wodhdhees.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawuloosi Teselonqe asaa zaari be7anaw amottis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Shin nu ishato, nuuni nu qofan gidonnashin, ashon hinttefe shaakettidi guutha wode gam77idayssan hinttena daro laamotidi be7anaw koyida. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nu simmi hintteko baanaw koyida. Taani ta huu7en hintteko baanaw koyas, shin Xalahey nuna diggis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiza, nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosi yaa wode, nu ufayssay woykko nu ceeqettiya nu kallachchay oonee? Hinttena gidekketiyye? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tuma hintte nu bonchchonne nu ufayssi.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuus genccanaw dandda7ettonna ixxin, Ateena kataman nurkka attanaw qofa qachchida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Ha@O 17:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hinttena zoranaadanne ammanon hinttena minthethanaada nuura issife Xoossas ootheyssanne Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa odiya nu ishaa Ximotiyoosa hintteko kiittida. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hinttena gakkida goodan hinttefe oonikka guye simmofo. He gooday nuus Xoossaa shene gideyssa hinttee, hintte huu7en ereeta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu hinttera de7iya wode goodi gakkanayssa hinttew koyrottidi odida. Hintte ereyssa mela hessada hanis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taw genccanaw dandda7ettona ixxin, “Ooni eri Xalahey entta paaccidi nu daaburaa mela ashshonna aggenna” gada hintte ammanuwabaa eranaw Ximotiyoosa hintteko kiittas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ha77i Ximotiyoosi hintte matappe yidi, hintte ammanuwabaanne hintte siiquwabaa lo77o wore nuus odis. Qassi hintte ubba wode nuus lo77o qoppeyssanne nuuni hinttena be7anaw laamoteyssada hintteka nuna be7anaw laamoteyssa I nuus odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Ha@O 18:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ta ishato, nuna gakkiya waayaninne nu meto ubban hintte ammanuwa gisho hinttenan minettida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hintte Godan minnidi de7ikko nukka de7on de7oos. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hiza, nuuni hintte gaason demmida ufayssas Xoossaa waati galatino? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni hinttena be7anawunne hintte ammanuwan paccidabaa kunthanaw qammanne gallas nu kumetha wozanan Xoossaa woossos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Xoossay nu aaway ba huu7eninne nu Goday Yesuus Kiristtoosi nu hintteko baana ogiya giigiso. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu hinttena daro doseyssada Goday hintte issoy issuwa siiqiya siiqonne ase ubbaa siiqiya siiqo hinttew darssonne gujjo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu Goday Yesuus Kiristtoosi ba geeshshatara yaa wode Xoossaa, nu aawa sinthan hintte wozanay geeshshinne borey baynnayssa oothidi I hinttena minthethana.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa ufayssiya de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wurssethan, ta ishato, Xoossaa ufayssanaw hintte waanidi daanaw bessiyako nuuppe tamaarideta. Hessi hintte koyroppe de7ida de7uwa, shin ha77i hintte kaseyssafe aathidi oothanaada Godaa Yesuusa sunthan hinttena woossosinne zoroos. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nuuni Godaa Yesuusa maatan hinttena kiittida kiitay awusseeko ereeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossay, hintte geeshshi gidana melanne laymatonna mela koyees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hintte issoy issoy, hintte machcheera geeshshatethaninne bonchchon daanaw bessees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossaa eronnanne ammanonna asada laymatetha amon xuugettofite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nu kase hinttew odidayssadanne minthi zoridayssada Goday hessa melabaa oothiya ubbaa pirddiya gisho, oonikka hayssatan ba ammaniyaa ishaa naaqqanawunne cimmanaw bessenna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Xoossay nuna geeshshtethan daana mela xeegisippe attin tunatethan daana mela xeegibeenna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ha timirttiya ixxiya oonikka hinttew Geeshsha Ayyaana immiya Xoossaa ixxeesppe attin ase gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hintte issoy issuwa waati siiqaneekko Xoossay hinttena tamaarssida gisho, ha77i siiqobaa nu hnttew xaafanaw koshshenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qassi Maqedooniya biittan de7iya ammaniyaa ishata ubbaa tuma hintte doseeta. Shin nu ishato, ha77ika hintte entta aathi dosana mela hinttena woossos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nuuni kase hinttew odidayssada woppu gida de7uwa de7ite. Hinttee, hintte ooso oothidi hinttew duussas koshshiyabaa demmite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessada hanikko, ammanonnayssata matan hintte bonchchettana; qassi hinttena koshshiyabas oonakka aadasheketa.</para>
  <para style="s">Godaa yuussabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nu ishato, ammanidi hayqqida asati hananabaa hintte erana mela nu koyoos. Hintte entta gisho ufayssi baynna asada kayottofite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nuuni, Yesuusi hayqqidayssanne qassi hayqoppe denddidayssa ammanoos. Hessadakka, Xoossay Yesuusa ammanidi hayqqidayssata iyara wolla ehanayssa ammanoos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Goday nuus odidayssada Goday yaa gallas iyara gayttanaw nuuni paxa de7eyssati, hayqqidayssatappe sinthatokko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1Qoro 15:51-52</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Goday wolqqaama kiitara, kiitanchchota halaqaa girssaraa, Xoossaa moyze punora, saloppe wodhdhana. Kiristtoosa ammanidi hayqqidayssati koyrottidi hayqoppe denddana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, he wode nuuni paxa de7eyssati, Godaara shaaran gayttanaw enttara issife salo ekettana. Hessafe guye, nuuni Godaara issife merinaw daana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ha qaalan issoy issuwa minthethite.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Godaa yuussaa giigidi naagite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato, ha hanoti hanana wodiyanne ageena hinttew xaafanaw koshshenna. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Goday Gallasay kaysoy qamma yeyssada yaanayssa hintte loythi ereeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Maato 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luuqa 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:10">2Phexi 3:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Asay, “Sa7i saro, aykkoyka hanenna” yaagishin, maccas iqethi oykkeyssada dhayoy entti qopponna entta bolla yaana. Entti ay ogenkka kessi ekkokona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin nu ishato, he gallasay hinttew kaysoy yeyssada yaanaw hintte dhuman de7ekketa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hintte ubbay poo7o asinne gallasan de7iya asi; nuuni qamma asi woykko dhuma asi gidokko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, nuuni harati dhiskkeyssada dhiskkanaw bessenna; nuuni barkkanwunne giigidi daanaw bessees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Dhiskkeyssati qamma dhiskkoosona; mathotteyssati qamma mathottosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin nuuni gallasa asi gidiya gisho giigidi daanaw bessees. Ammanonne siiqo xurureda tiran ma77idi, atotethaa ufayssaa huu7en wothiya ola biraata barneexada wothidi daanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe 6:13-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Xoossay nuna nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara kumetha atotethi ekkana mela doorisppe attin hanqos dooribeenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nuuni paxa de7in woykko hayqqin, Kiristtoosi yaa wode iyara issife daana mela Kiristtoosi nu gisho hayqqis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte kase ootheyssada, issoy issuwa minthethitenne dichchite.</para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetha zorenne sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nu ishato, hintte giddon ootheyssata, hinttena kaalethana melanne zorana mela Goday dooridayssata bonchchana mela hinttena woossos. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti oothiya oosuwa gisho, entta daro bonchchitenne siiqite. Issoy issuwara sarotethan de7ite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nu ishato, nuuni hinttena zoroos. Boozata hanqite; babbeyssata minthethite; daaburanchchota maaddite; ase ubbaa dandda7ite. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Oonikka iita gisho iita zaaronna mela naagettite. Hintte wolisinne asa ubbaas lo77obaa oothanaw minnite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ubba wode ufayttite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ubba wode Xoossaa woossite. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ubbaban galatite. Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara Xoossay hinttefe koyey hessa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaana oosuwa toysoppite. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tinbbite qaala kadhoppite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ubbabaa paaccite; lo77obaa ekkite. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iita ooso ubbaafe haakkite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Saro immiya Xoossay ba huu7en hinttena polo geeshsho. Nu Goday Yesuus Kiristtoosi yaana gallasaas, Xoossay hintte ayyaanaa, hintte shemppuwanne hintte kumetha asatethaa borey baynna naago. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hinttena xeegeyssi ammanettidayssa gidiya gisho, hessa I polana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu ishato, nuus Xoossaa woossite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ammaniya asa ubbaa geeshsha yeeretethan woli sarothite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hintte ha kiitaa ammaniyaa asa ubbaas nabbabanaada Godaa sunthan hinttena woossays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nu Godaa Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatethay hinttera issife gido. Amin7i.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
